<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-INSIGHT-Australian Gold Index at critical support.</title>
<headline>RTRS-INSIGHT-Australian Gold Index at critical support.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian gold index looks set to consolidate at lower levels above support at 1,700 and 1,685.</p>
</text>
